@startuml
title COLORS - Activity Diagram\nUser workflow

skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultFontSize 14
skinparam dpi 140
skinparam ArrowColor #333333
skinparam ActivityBackgroundColor #F2F6FC
skinparam ActivityBorderColor #333333
skinparam ActivityDiamondBackgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam ActivityDiamondBorderColor #333333
skinparam ActivityStartColor #333333
skinparam ActivityEndColor #333333
skinparam LegendBackgroundColor white
skinparam LegendBorderColor #AAAAAA

start
:Open the login page;

repeat
  :Enter username and password\nand click the login button;
  :Validate login credentials;
  backward:Display "User/Password\ncombination incorrect";
repeat while (Login successful?) is (no) not (yes)

:Open the color page;

:Choose Add Color,\nSearch Colors, or Log Out;
while (Log Out selected?) is (no)
  if (Add Color selected?) then (yes)
    :Enter color name and\nclick Add Color;
    :Save the color for\nthe logged-in user;
    :Display "Color has been added";
  else (Search Colors)
    :Enter search text and\nclick Search Color;
    :Search the logged-in user's\nsaved colors;
    if (Matching colors found?) then (yes)
      :Display the matching color names;
    else (no)
      :Keep the displayed color list unchanged;
    endif
  endif
  :Choose Add Color,\nSearch Colors, or Log Out;
endwhile (yes)

:Log out;
:Return to the login page;
stop

legend bottom left
  Scope: Normal user workflow with completed requests and an available database.
  Add Color and Search Colors can be repeated in any order before logging out.
endlegend

' Notation reference: lecture [5.2] Designing the Modules-1.pdf, slide 26;
' Introduction to UML.pdf, slides 82-83.
'
' Source verification:
' js/code.js doLogin(): MD5 hash, Login.php request, id < 1 check, cookie, redirect.
' LAMPAPI/Login.php: Users lookup; failed login response contains id = 0.
' js/code.js saveCookie(): firstName, lastName, userId, 20-minute expiry.
' color.html DOMContentLoaded invokes readCookie() before normal user interaction.
' js/code.js addColor(): sends color/userId; any HTTP 200 displays a success message.
' LAMPAPI/AddColor.php: INSERT into Colors (UserId,Name).
' js/code.js searchColor(): sends search/userId; sets retrieval status text before
' parsing response JSON and reading jsonObject.results.length. css/styles.css sets
' #colorSearchResult to display: none, so this status text is not visible to the user.
' LAMPAPI/SearchColors.php: Name LIKE %search% AND UserID = userId; no matches
' returns error "No Records Found" without a results property.
' The missing results property causes an exception inside the asynchronous callback;
' the outer try/catch does not handle that callback exception or update colorList.
' At this diagram's user-workflow level, the visible result is an unchanged list
' with no search message. Implementation details belong in source comments only.
' js/code.js doLogout(): clears browser identity, expires cookie, redirects to index.html.
'
' Loops represent repeated user interactions; they are not JavaScript while loops.
' Search/add do not reauthenticate, refresh the cookie, or automatically load all colors.
' Registration, edit, and delete operations are absent from the implementation.
@enduml
